    "notes": "Stores the phone number and makes its tel: address from it; the redefinition makes the address with the editor's markers taken out, so that \\makecvheader's link holds none. The LaTeX is adapted from the port's rt-awesome-cv.cls, a modified version of awesome-cv.cls, under the LPPL 1.3c.",
